   "title": "Inflammatory back pain or lower-limb oligoarthritis, rheumatoid factor NEGATIVE: which spondyloarthritis (SpA)?",
   "lines": [
    "SpA features: inflammatory back pain · arthritis · enthesitis (heel) · anterior uveitis · dactylitis · psoriasis · Crohn's or colitis · good response to NSAIDs · family history · HLA-B27 · raised CRP",
    "imaging: sacroiliitis on X-ray or MRI · predisposing: infection (Chlamydia) · psoriasis · Crohn's, ulcerative colitis",
    "family: ankylosing spondylitis · psoriatic · reactive · arthritis with Crohn's or ulcerative colitis · acute anterior uveitis · undifferentiated · juvenile (enthesitis-related)"
   ]
  },
